{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15581","headline":"秋夜听捣衣 · 杨凝","name":"秋夜听捣衣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"砧杵闻秋夜，裁缝寄远方。\n声微渐湿露，响细未经霜。\n兰牖唯遮树，风帘不碍凉。\n云中望何处，听此断人肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}